249
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:16,710
And there was a
thunderstorm coming in.

250
00:12:16,710 --> 00:12:19,010
So we just landed in an airport.

251
00:12:19,010 --> 00:12:21,270
It was probably
gusting about 30 knots

252
00:12:21,270 --> 00:12:23,870
at the time, which isn't that
bad for a Robinson, a four

253
00:12:23,870 --> 00:12:25,010
seat Robinson.

254
00:12:25,010 --> 00:12:27,400
Put the helicopter in a hangar.

255
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:28,740
There's a huge storm.

