295
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:23,140
And always remember that it's
a big aviation community.

296
00:14:23,140 --> 00:14:25,390
There's a lot of people that
are happy to go flying--

297
00:14:25,390 --> 00:14:28,800
can send mail to the members
of the MIT Flying Club

298
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:30,180
